cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use branching-story-mcp in research or production, please cite it as
  below and cite the bundled benchmark dataset by its DOI.
title: "branching-story-mcp: A zero-dependency Model Context Protocol server for deterministic story state and the 2026 Consumer AI Story Continuity Benchmark"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Ouba Studio
    email: team@ouba.art
    website: https://www.ouba.art
date-released: "2026-11-27"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ouba-studio/branching-story-mcp"
website: "https://www.ouba.art/tools/benchmark-explorer"
abstract: >-
  branching-story-mcp exposes Ouba Studio's deterministic branching-story-kit
  story-state kernel and the CC-BY-4.0 2026 Consumer AI Story Continuity
  Benchmark to AI agents over the Model Context Protocol. It ships four tools
  (validate_story_graph, step_story_state, query_ai_story_benchmark,
  detect_state_drift) and two resources, with zero runtime dependencies in both
  the Python and the Node/ESM implementations.
identifiers:
